Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Too weak to make a move?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I play this face down and end my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the rest of\Nyour life points, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning knuckle attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you were the only one\Nwith a space suit, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you activated my\NAura Armor Trap Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Detecting Ritual Armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided the only way to beat you\Nwas to fight armor with armor. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,One more round and one more attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Last man standing wins the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the next round, one of them's going\Nto be trapped by the seal forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:00:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yarn Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yarn Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yarn Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no time to rest Joey's probably
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,dueling that Valon guy\Nright now Which means,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,if we don't hurry, he'll be one soul short\NThat's why I stopped According to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,he's nearby We need to stop running\Nand start looking down each street
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.21,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure, but just a moment ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I could sense the presence of\NJoey's legendary dragon card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.89,0:02:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey must have played Hermos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear his dragon was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think Joey lost, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dea, I can't be sure until we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know how you got\Nyourself out of my last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have one more shot to take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And there are way too many people counting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,on me to let you walk away with a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, like you're gonna walk away with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, it looks to me like you can\Nbarely stand, let alone walk, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And might I remind you, there's\Nsomeone counting on my victory too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of these two numbskulls thinks\Nthey're gonna save me by winning. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't need to be saved all i need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,is my victory over wheeler since i want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep this armor on i'm gonna have\Nto give up half my life points then
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll place these two cards face down\Nlet's see what you got With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll start\Nthings off by bringing my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,psychic armor head back\Nfrom the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:04:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll stir things up\Nby playing this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Phoenix Gravitation!\NOh, man. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This card lets me build a suit of\Narmor with parts from my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So return to me, Burning\NKnuckles, Jet Gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Overboost and Active Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My ultimate weapon is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta say it's been fun,\NWheeler, but all good things must
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:05:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,come to an end and i'm planning to\Nsend you off with a bang right now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,your helmet must be on too tight\Nbecause you forgot all about the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,two facedown cards i played and\Nnow for the first one grave robber
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, take a guess which card he stole from\Nyour graveyard Show me It's Big Bang Blow
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, and now for my next draft\Ncard. It's called Take One Chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It transfers a random\Ncard from my graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,right to the field The rest is up to fate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one card that can save me now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the Claw of Hamels,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but wait, I'm not done yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,here comes the best part, because now,\NI'm merging my two cards together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Presenting Big Bang Dragon Blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So how do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.11,0:06:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I took your weapon and made it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I think you're\Nat the end of your rope,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you come back with something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never fought a duel\Nlike this in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pushing me to be my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll make my victory\Nall the more rewarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning knuckle strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bang Dragon Blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:06:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the power of my dragon behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good, Wheeler,\Nbut not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's all over. You wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to activate Big Bang\NDragon Blow's special effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,By sacrificing my red eyes, I made\Nmy arm and fist even more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's able to destroy\Nall your monsters and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,subtract their strength\Nfrom your life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I caused my own downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if I won, I could make\Nyou forget about Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I understand why\Nhe meant so much to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy's got heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.87,0:08:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Leviathan, I sense the\Narrival of a powerful soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see who, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what the Orykalkos dragged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My former employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's Miss Valentine's\Nturn to send me a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Or to give up her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuri Kalkos has him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that deep down you\Nfeel the same way I do, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lonely and misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we need each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:09:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Balan's the one who told me\Nyou have to duel for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he turns around and\Nfights you to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He deserved this. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.57,0:10:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Mai, Valon realized\Nwhat he told you was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He found out what dueling is really about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Determination and heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.87,0:10:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought like a true duelist today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.07,0:10:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you wanted to\Ndestroy him. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Valon may have annoyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one deserves to\Nhave their soul taken away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.35,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and then held captive by\Nsome power-hungry psychopath,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize something now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as that Ori Calcos thing\Nhas control over your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to\Ntalk any sense into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, the only way I can\Nsave you at this point is to duel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you beat this loser, and\Nnow it's gone to your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't like that, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would you be dumb\Nenough to challenge me to a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have learned your\Nlesson from our last match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way I can get through\Nto you is by dueling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We've searched every\Nblock, and no sign of Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that tracking system screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right, Yuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This way. Quickly! Yuge, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about a block away\Nfrom Paragia's headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And so far, the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you may have spoken\Na little too soon, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.51,0:12:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it looks like\Nwe've got some company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something I\Ncan help you boys with?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you freaks\Nare Or even if you exist at all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't have any time to play\Ngames So I suggest you back off
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm even gonna let you go first my big
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,mistake watch this i call my cyber harpy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to the field in attack mode of course\Nthat's all for now i hope you'd say that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,man that last duel really did a number on\Nme i'm exhausted i can barely draw my card
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This should keep your harpies busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Blue Flame Swordsman,\Nand I'll put him in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so weak, I can't even see straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter what, I gotta stay\Non my feet and finish this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My, it's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You just played a monster that has\Nthe same attack strength as my harpy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And you ended your turn. You better\Nnot be taking it easy on me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, I want a real duel.\NThis duel is real. Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,no one's going easy on anybody anymore\NActually, I'm doing just the opposite now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting you with\Nall my heart and soul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to save\Nyou. Try saving yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing just fine without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cramp my style, you\Nend up in a world of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.09,0:13:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand everything now, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot what dueling's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm here to remind you\Nabout the heart of the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.31,0:14:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you're gonna teach\Nme a lesson about duel monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you're wasting your time and my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, for my next maneuver,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to double your fun with\Nanother Cyber Harpy in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play my Arrow Nail Magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives my Cyber Harpy an\Nextra 300 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,These Harpies are tearing\Nme apart over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Harpy, attack his Flame\NSwordsman with Shadow Nail Slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as Blue Flame Swordsman is\Ndestroyed, his special ability activates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:15:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the original Flame Swordsman is\Nautomatically summoned in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My Swordsman is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your cyber harpy ready to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I assume she'd prefer\Nto sit this one out instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm that dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of our monsters have the\Nsame number of attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so they'd both be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I place a card face down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.69,0:15:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't take my bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And with two harpies on the field,\NMai's got the clear advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a strategy, and I need it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling I've\Nseen that face-down card before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice one scapegoat,\Nso my panther can attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my face-down card,\NHarpy Lady Feral Formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My Harpy ladies have all joined\Nforces to repel your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I dueled Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was letting her beat me because\NI didn't want her to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But it completely backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So this time, I'm giving it all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.83,0:16:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Flame Swordsman, so I can\Nsummon Cybertech Alligator in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cybertech Alligator, attack Cyber Harpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.85,0:17:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, you're giving\Nme a real challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna have\Nto do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.27,0:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Because before my arrow\Nnail goes to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's transferring its power\Nto my other heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I placed one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty confident for\Nsomeone who's about to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stand back. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Oricalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:17:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the seal of Oricalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it means someone's\Ngoing to lose their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're both locked in the seal,\Nand only one of us will escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can come to your rescue now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you, me, and the most powerful\Nmagic card that's ever been created.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expecting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the Seal of Ori\NKalkos is on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the evil that controls Mai\Njust got ten times stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know the real Mai\Nis in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna set her free,\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.03,0:18:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon another Cyber Harpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's two if you're keeping score.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my shiny new magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:19:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of my Harpies gets an\Nextra 500 attack points now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear his gator to shreds\Nwith Shadow Nail Slice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's monster number two's turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your Harpies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, scapegoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to go through\Nthem to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You use that card every duel, so\Nforgive me for not being shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal trap card, Nightmare Tri-Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It casts a reflection of your\Nfour scapegoats. After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,it transforms that reflection into four\Nnew monsters on my side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That means thanks to you, I now have four\Nmore cyber harpies to add to my flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Harpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush his scapegoat token!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.93,0:20:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, my four new Harpies\Ncan't attack until next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll take a break for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.69,0:20:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But you better think of\Nsome new tricks, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've seen all\Nof your moves before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you hear me loud and clear and don't worry\Ni got a few new twists planned you should
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,know by now your bluffs don't work on me\Nyou're going down and i'm going straight
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to the top there's nowhere to run wheeler\Ndon't worry i don't plan on running
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,away i'm gonna keep fighting until i break\Nthrough to you my or lose my soul trying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.85,0:20:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
